cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fair-ca-visualization, please cite it as below."
title: "fair-ca-visualization: interactive visualization of the FAIR COMBINE Archive Indicators"
abstract: "fair-ca-visualization is a Streamlit app and python package for the interactive visualization of assessments of computational models with the FAIR COMBINE Archive Indicators (FAIR-CA), an adaptation of the FAIR indicators of the Research Data Alliance to models encoded in COMBINE standards."
